{"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"AdaEngine"}],"title":"Known issues and how to debug SPM targets","roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/documentation\/AdaEngine\/SPMDebug"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Xcode-Instruments-Required-kernel-recording-resources-are-in-use-by-another-document","text":"Xcode Instruments: “Required kernel recording resources are in use by another document”","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When profiling an SPM project (without an xcodeproj) in Instruments, you may see a message about kernel recording resources being in use, even when no other Instruments documents are open.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" The message is misleading. The real cause is that the binary does not have the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"get-task-allow"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement. SPM does not distinguish between “release” and “profiling,” so profiling uses a release build without this entitlement."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Solution:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Re-sign the binary with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"get-task-allow","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement before launching Instruments.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Open your scheme (Cmd-Shift-,).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Profile → Pre-actions","type":"text"}]},{"text":", add a Pre-action.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the shell to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/bin\/zsh"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Paste the re-sign script below (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"=(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" syntax is zsh process substitution):","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"code":["# For Instruments, re-sign binary with get-task-allow entitlement","codesign -s - -v -f --entitlements =(echo -n '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>","<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-\/\/Apple\/\/DTD PLIST 1.0\/\/EN\" \"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/DTDs\/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">","<plist version=\"1.0\">","    <dict>","        <key>com.apple.security.get-task-allow<\/key>","        <true\/>","    <\/dict>","<\/plist>') ${TARGET_BUILD_DIR}\/${PRODUCT_NAME}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"zsh"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See also: "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoaphony.micro.blog\/2022\/10\/29\/solving-required-kernel.html","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" (Rob Napier)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The script is stored in ","type":"text"},{"code":".swiftpm\/xcode\/xcshareddata\/xcschemes\/<schemename>.xcscheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The pre-action runs only for Profile, so it does not affect normal builds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Pre-action scripts do not receive "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SRCROOT"},{"type":"text","text":"; if the script fails, Xcode will not show details—check Console.app for logs."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/documentation\/AdaEngine"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adaengine\/spmdebug"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://AdaEngine/documentation/AdaEngine":{"title":"AdaEngine","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Bringing simple and powerful game engine for your awesome games.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/documentation\/AdaEngine","url":"\/documentation\/adaengine"},"https://cocoaphony.micro.blog/2022/10/29/solving-required-kernel.html":{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoaphony.micro.blog\/2022\/10\/29\/solving-required-kernel.html","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Solving “Required kernel recording resources…” in Instruments","type":"text"}],"title":"Solving “Required kernel recording resources…” in Instruments","url":"https:\/\/cocoaphony.micro.blog\/2022\/10\/29\/solving-required-kernel.html","type":"link"}}}